      "label": "Snapchat filter usage",
      "description": "The meme relies on the cultural phenomenon of using photo filters on social media platforms like Snapchat to alter one's appearance, often for humorous or deceptive purposes. This is a common social trend that enables users to temporarily change their look, which is central to the joke in the meme.",
