      "instance_name": "Impersonation_stereotype",
      "label": "Impersonation stereotype",
      "description": "The meme plays on the stereotype of people trying to impersonate others, often through digital means, to avoid responsibility or to create humor. This is a common trope in internet culture, where people joke about pretending to be someone else online.",
